    {
      "type": "grammar",
      "id": "u07.d01.grammar",
      "title": {
        "en": "Ordering politely",
        "ru": "Заказываем вежливо"
      },
      "rule": {
        "en": "To order, use \"I'd like\" (= I would like) or \"Can I have…?\". \"I want\" sounds rude in a café.",
        "ru": "Чтобы заказать, говори \"I'd like\" (= I would like) или \"Can I have…?\". \"I want\" в кафе звучит грубо."
      },
      "patterns": [
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "Request",
            "ru": "Просьба"
          },
          "formula": "I'd like + a/some + noun",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "I'd like a coffee, please.",
              "ru": "Мне, пожалуйста, кофе."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "Offer",
            "ru": "Предложение"
          },
          "formula": "Would you like + some + noun ?",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "Would you like some water?",
              "ru": "Хотите воды?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "en": "Asking for something",
            "ru": "Просим что-то"
          },
          "formula": "Can I have + noun, please ?",
          "examples": [
            {
              "en": "Can I have the bill, please?",
              "ru": "Можно счёт, пожалуйста?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "pitfalls": [
        {
          "en": "Don't order with \"I want\" — use \"I'd like\" or \"Can I have\". \"I want\" is too direct here.",
          "ru": "Не заказывай через \"I want\" — говори \"I'd like\" или \"Can I have\". \"I want\" здесь слишком прямо."
        },
        {
          "en": "Use \"some\" (not \"a\") with uncountable food: \"some water\", \"some rice\", \"some bread\".",
          "ru": "С неисчисляемой едой ставь \"some\" (не \"a\"): \"some water\", \"some rice\", \"some bread\"."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "reading",
      "id": "u07.d01.reading",
      "title": {
        "en": "Lunch break",
        "ru": "Обеденный перерыв"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "u07.d01.reading.b1",
          "en": "It was lunchtime, so I went to a small café near the office. A waiter came and gave me the menu.",
          "ru": "Был обед, и я пошёл в маленькое кафе рядом с офисом. Официант подошёл и дал мне меню.",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u07.d01.reading.b1.mp3",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "u07.d01.reading.b2",
          "en": "I'd like a coffee and a cheese sandwich, please, I said. Would you like some water too? he asked. Yes, please. Can I have the bill after?",
          "ru": "«Мне, пожалуйста, кофе и сэндвич с сыром», — сказал я. «Хотите ещё воды?» — спросил он. «Да, пожалуйста. Можно потом счёт?»",
          "audio": {
            "src": "media/audio/u07.d01.reading.b2.mp3",
            "license": {
              "type": "original",
              "attribution": "Project authors (LLM-assisted)"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
